sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 业务方
    participant Browser as 任务看板<br/>(HTML)
    participant API as WorkflowController
    participant Flowable as Flowable 引擎
    participant DB as MySQL

    User->>Browser: 打开 http://localhost:8080/task-board.html
    Browser->>API: GET /api/custody/tasks?assignee=张三
    API->>Flowable: taskService.createTaskQuery()
    Flowable-->>API: List<Task>
    API-->>Browser: 任务列表 JSON

    User->>Browser: 点击 "完成"
    Browser->>API: POST /api/custody/tasks/{id}/complete
    API->>Flowable: taskService.complete(id)
    Flowable->>Flowable: 触发 ServiceTask (JavaDelegate)
    Flowable->>DB: 写业务表 (voucher/clearing/reconciliation/fund_valuation)
    DB-->>Flowable: OK
    Flowable-->>API: 任务完成
    API-->>Browser: { status: COMPLETED }

    Browser->>API: GET /api/custody/daily-reconcile/stats
    API->>DB: SELECT COUNT(*) FROM reconciliation_log
    DB-->>API: 统计结果
    API-->>Browser: { total: 5, autoPassed: 4, adjusted: 1 }
